# NEAR frontend

- Wallet: `@hot-labs/near-connect` via `frontend/src/providers/near-provider.tsx`.
- Reads: `viewFunction`; writes: `callFunction` (wallet must be signed in).
- Amounts: yoctoNEAR strings; default gas ~30 TGas unless the contract requires more.
- Network + contract IDs: `frontend/src/config.ts` — keep testnet/mainnet addresses in sync after deploy.
- For new UI or wallet flows, follow `.agents/skills/near-dapp/` and `near-api-js` skill references.
